msgid "%1$s = %2$s: %3$s (using %4$s)"
msgstr "%1$s = %2$s：%3$s（已改用 %4$s）"

msgid "%1$s at %2$s gives %3$d%% output"
msgstr "%1$s 在 %2$s 时输出 %3$d%%"

msgid "%1$s must be a whole number between %2$s and %3$s."
msgstr "%1$s 必须是 %2$s 到 %3$s 之间的整数。"

msgid "%s is not a pair of whole numbers."
msgstr "%s 不是一对整数。"

msgid "%s s remaining"
msgstr "还需 %s 秒"

msgid "%s °C"
msgstr "%s °C"

msgid "%s · raised by the kernel floor"
msgstr "%s · 已被内核下限抬高"

msgid "0 is stopped, 255 is full speed."
msgstr "0 为停转，255 为全速。"

msgid "5G modem"
msgstr "5G 模组"

msgid "Add point"
msgstr "添加节点"

msgid "Allowed"
msgstr "取值范围"

msgid "Applied by controller"
msgstr "控制器已输出"

msgid "Apply now"
msgstr "立即应用"

msgid ""
"Apply runs one control cycle immediately. The controller reloads its configuration by itself, so saving never restarts the service."
msgstr "「立即应用」会马上执行一个控制周期。控制器自身会重新读取配置，因此保存不会重启服务。"

msgid "Applying failed: %s"
msgstr "应用失败：%s"

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自动"

msgid "Automatic curve"
msgstr "自动曲线"

msgid ""
"Automatic uses the fan curve, Manual keeps a fixed output, Kernel protection only leaves the fan to the kernel."
msgstr "自动模式使用风扇曲线；手动模式保持固定输出；仅内核保护则把风扇完全交给内核。"

msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "均衡"

msgid "Balanced curve"
msgstr "均衡曲线"

msgid ""
"Balances cooling against noise without touching the kernel CPU throttling, hot or critical protection."
msgstr "在散热与噪音之间取得平衡，同时不影响内核的 CPU 降频、高温及 critical 过热保护。"

msgid "Blue dashed: target output"
msgstr "蓝色虚线：目标输出"

msgid "CPU"
msgstr "CPU"

msgid "CPU only"
msgstr "仅 CPU"

msgid "CPU throttling device"
msgstr "CPU 降频设备"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Choose enabled or disabled."
msgstr "请选择启用或禁用。"

msgid "Code"
msgstr "事件码"

msgid ""
"Comma separated temperature:percent pairs, temperatures strictly increasing."
msgstr "以逗号分隔的「温度:百分比」对，温度必须严格递增。"

msgid "Configuration check"
msgstr "配置检查"

msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "配置文件"

msgid "Configuration unchanged; one control cycle ran."
msgstr "配置未变化；已执行一个控制周期。"

msgid "Consecutive failures"
msgstr "连续失败次数"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "继续"

msgid "Control reason"
msgstr "控制归因"

msgid "Control temperature"
msgstr "控制温度"

msgid "Control temperature source"
msgstr "控制温度来源"

msgid "Controller"
msgstr "控制器"

msgid "Controller error"
msgstr "控制器异常"

msgid "Controller not running"
msgstr "控制器未运行"

msgid "Controller version"
msgstr "控制器版本"

msgid "Cooling levels"
msgstr "散热档位"

msgid "Cooling profile"
msgstr "风扇曲线"

msgid "Corrections the controller applied while reading the configuration file."
msgstr "控制器读取配置文件时所做的修正。"

msgid "Critical trip"
msgstr "critical 触发点"

msgid "Curve failsafe"
msgstr "曲线失效保护"

msgid "Curve invalid"
msgstr "曲线无效"

msgid "Curve unavailable: %s"
msgstr "曲线不可用：%s"

msgid "Curve: %s"
msgstr "曲线：%s"

msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定义"

msgid "Custom curve"
msgstr "自定义曲线"

msgid "Custom curve points"
msgstr "自定义曲线节点"

msgid "Cycles"
msgstr "控制周期数"

msgid "Defaults loaded into the form. Save to store them."
msgstr "已把出厂默认值填入表单，保存后才会写入。"

msgid "Delete point"
msgstr "删除该节点"

msgid "Detail"
msgstr "详细说明"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断与日志"

msgid ""
"Editing here only changes the page. Use Save to store it, and the chart updates live."
msgstr "在此编辑只影响页面，保存后才会写入；曲线图会实时更新。"

msgid "Effective curve"
msgstr "当前生效曲线"

msgid "Effective values"
msgstr "生效值"

msgid "Enable enhanced controller"
msgstr "启用增强控制器"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

msgid "Ethernet PHY"
msgstr "以太网 PHY"

msgid "Event journal"
msgstr "事件日志"

msgid ""
"Every point on the line is the output the controller applies at that temperature."
msgstr "线上每一点都是控制器在该温度下实际施加的输出。"

msgid ""
"Extra degrees applied when slowing down, so the fan does not oscillate around a curve point."
msgstr "降速时额外叠加的温度，避免风扇在曲线拐点附近反复波动。"

msgid "Failsafe cooling"
msgstr "失效保护散热"

msgid "Failsafe cooling active"
msgstr "失效保护散热中"

msgid "Failsafe output"
msgstr "失效保护输出"

msgid "Fan"
msgstr "风扇"

msgid "Fan Control"
msgstr "风扇控制"

msgid "Fan control"
msgstr "风扇控制"

msgid "Fan control node not found"
msgstr "未找到风扇控制节点"

msgid "Fan cooling device"
msgstr "风扇散热设备"

msgid "Fan curve"
msgstr "温控曲线"

msgid "Fan diagram"
msgstr "风扇示意图"

msgid "Fan output %1$s, %2$s"
msgstr "风扇输出 %1$s，%2$s"

msgid "Fan ownership"
msgstr "风扇控制权"

msgid "Floor basis"
msgstr "下限依据"

msgid "Governor hijacked"
msgstr "governor 被接管"

msgid "H5000M cooling management"
msgstr "H5000M 散热管理"

msgid "Health"
msgstr "健康状态"

msgid ""
"Hold the current output this long before slowing down. Speed-ups stay immediate."
msgstr "降速前先维持当前输出这么长时间；提速始终立即生效。"

msgid "Holding output before slowing down"
msgstr "降速前维持输出"

msgid "Hottest valid sensor"
msgstr "最高有效传感器"

msgid "Just now"
msgstr "刚刚"

msgid "Kernel drives the fan"
msgstr "由内核驱动风扇"

msgid "Kernel floor"
msgstr "内核下限"

msgid "Kernel protection"
msgstr "内核保护"

msgid "Kernel protection only"
msgstr "仅内核保护"

msgid "Kernel protections"
msgstr "内核保护"

msgid "Kernel safety floor"
msgstr "内核安全下限"

msgid "Last %s s ago"
msgstr "%s 秒前"

msgid "Last error"
msgstr "最近错误"

msgid "Last good cycle"
msgstr "最近成功周期"

msgid "Legacy policy record"
msgstr "历史策略记录"

msgid "Level"
msgstr "级别"

msgid "Live output"
msgstr "实时输出"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "加载中…"

msgid "Lock directory"
msgstr "锁目录"

msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手动"

msgid "Manual PWM output"
msgstr "手动 PWM 输出"

msgid ""
"Manual output 0 commands the fan to stop. Temperatures will rise; the kernel floor may still raise the output. Continue?"
msgstr "手动输出 0 会让风扇停转，温度将上升；内核安全下限仍可能抬高输出。确定继续？"

msgid ""
"Manual output below 80/255 often cannot keep the fan spinning under load. Continue?"
msgstr "手动输出低于 80/255 时，带载下风扇常常无法维持转动。确定继续？"

msgid "Manual request"
msgstr "手动请求"

msgid "Marker: current control temperature"
msgstr "标记：当前控制温度"

msgid "Message"
msgstr "内容"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

msgid "Mode: %s"
msgstr "模式：%s"

msgid ""
"Native thermal and hwmon readings win; the vendor radio query is only a bounded fallback. The colour bands are this project’s own reference ranges, not a vendor specification."
msgstr "原生 thermal 与 hwmon 读数优先；厂商射频查询只是有界回退。颜色分段是本项目的参考区间，不是厂商规格。"

msgid "Never"
msgstr "从未"

msgid "Never sampled"
msgstr "尚无采样"

msgid "No changes to save."
msgstr "没有需要保存的更改。"

msgid "No cycle published yet"
msgstr "尚未发布控制周期"

msgid "No data available yet."
msgstr "暂时还没有数据。"

msgid "No events recorded yet"
msgstr "暂无事件记录"

msgid "No feedback"
msgstr "无转速反馈"

msgid "No output reading"
msgstr "无输出读数"

msgid "No valid sensor"
msgstr "无有效传感器"

msgid "Nothing was saved. Please correct:"
msgstr "未保存任何更改，请先修正："

msgid "Only used in automatic mode."
msgstr "仅在自动模式下使用。"

msgid "Operating mode"
msgstr "运行模式"

msgid "Output %"
msgstr "输出百分比"

msgid "Output %d%%"
msgstr "输出 %d%%"

msgid "Outputs"
msgstr "输出"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "总览"

msgid "Percentage %s is above 100%."
msgstr "百分比 %s 超过 100%。"

msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

msgid "Performance curve"
msgstr "性能曲线"

msgid "Pick one of the listed values."
msgstr "请从候选值中选择。"

msgid "Please confirm"
msgstr "请确认"

msgid "Preset used by the Balanced profile."
msgstr "均衡档所使用的预设曲线。"

msgid "Preset used by the Performance profile."
msgstr "性能档所使用的预设曲线。"

msgid "Preset used by the Quiet profile. Restore defaults puts this line back."
msgstr "静音档所使用的预设曲线，恢复默认值会还原此行。"

msgid "Quiet"
msgstr "静音"

msgid "Quiet curve"
msgstr "静音曲线"

msgid "Raised by the kernel floor"
msgstr "已被内核下限抬高"

msgid ""
"Read-only view of the thermal zone, its governor and the trip points the firmware declares."
msgstr "只读展示散热区、其 governor 以及固件声明的触发点。"

msgid "Reading the controller failed"
msgstr "读取控制器失败"

msgid "Recent events"
msgstr "最近事件"

msgid "Red dashed: kernel safety floor"
msgstr "红色虚线：内核安全下限"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

msgid "Register readback"
msgstr "寄存器回读"

msgid "Remove last"
msgstr "删除末尾节点"

msgid "Reported by the tachometer"
msgstr "来自测速风扇脚"

msgid "Requested"
msgstr "请求输出"

msgid "Requested output"
msgstr "请求输出"

msgid "Restart service"
msgstr "重启服务"

msgid ""
"Restart the fan control service? The fan keeps its current output while the service restarts."
msgstr "要重启风扇控制服务吗？重启期间风扇保持当前输出。"

msgid "Restore all defaults"
msgstr "恢复全部默认值"

msgid "Restore default curve"
msgstr "还原默认曲线"

msgid ""
"Restore every option to the values shipped with the package? Nothing is written until you save."
msgstr "把所有选项恢复为软件包出厂值？保存之前不会写入任何内容。"

msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

msgid "Revert"
msgstr "撤销更改"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "Running normally"
msgstr "运行正常"

msgid "Sampling and safety"
msgstr "采样与安全"

msgid "Sampling interval"
msgstr "采样间隔"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid "Save & Apply"
msgstr "保存并应用"

msgid "Saved %s"
msgstr "已保存%s"

msgid "Saving cancelled; your input is still in the form."
msgstr "已取消保存；你的输入仍保留在表单中。"

msgid "Saving failed: %s"
msgstr "保存失败：%s"

msgid "Schema version"
msgstr "配置版本"

msgid ""
"Schematic fan. The animation follows the applied controller output and is not a measured shaft speed."
msgstr "风扇示意图。动画跟随控制器输出的实际值，不是实测转速。"

msgid ""
"Schematic only. The animation follows the applied output, it is not a measured speed."
msgstr "仅为示意。动画跟随已输出的百分比，不是实测转速。"

msgid ""
"Seconds between control decisions. The page refreshes independently of this."
msgstr "两次控制决策之间的秒数。页面刷新节奏与此独立。"

msgid "Sections"
msgstr "分区"

msgid "Sensor"
msgstr "传感器"

msgid "Sensor failsafe"
msgstr "传感器失效保护"

msgid "Service restarted."
msgstr "服务已重启。"

msgid "Set 0 to disable the boost."
msgstr "设为 0 即关闭启动助推。"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "系统设置"

msgid "Settings saved and applied."
msgstr "设置已保存并应用。"

msgid ""
"Settings saved. The controller picks them up within one control interval."
msgstr "设置已保存，控制器会在一个采样周期内生效。"

msgid "Settings saved; no control-relevant value changed."
msgstr "设置已保存；没有影响控制的取值变化。"

msgid "Short high pulse written only when the fan is standing still."
msgstr "仅在风扇静止时写入的短促高电平启动脉冲。"

msgid "Showing the last successful reading."
msgstr "当前显示的是最近一次成功读取的数据。"

msgid "Snapshot age"
msgstr "快照时效"

msgid "Solid green: the control function"
msgstr "绿色实线：控制函数"

msgid "Source"
msgstr "来源"

msgid "Spin-down delay"
msgstr "降速延迟"

msgid "Spin-down hold"
msgstr "降速保持"

msgid "Startup boost"
msgstr "启动助推"

msgid "Startup boost PWM"
msgstr "启动助推 PWM"

msgid "Startup boost duration"
msgstr "启动助推时长"

msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "State file"
msgstr "状态文件"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Status is stale"
msgstr "状态已过期"

msgid "Status source"
msgstr "状态来源"

msgid "Stopped by policy"
msgstr "策略已停转"

msgid "Tachometer"
msgstr "转速反馈"

msgid "Target"
msgstr "目标输出"

msgid "Target output"
msgstr "目标输出"

msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "温度监控"

msgid "Temperature %s °C does not rise above %s °C."
msgstr "温度 %s °C 未高于前一点 %s °C。"

msgid "Temperature %s °C is above the supported 150 °C."
msgstr "温度 %s °C 超出支持的 150 °C。"

msgid "Temperature (°C)"
msgstr "温度（°C）"

msgid "Temperature hysteresis"
msgstr "温度滞回"

msgid "Temperature monitor"
msgstr "温度监控"

msgid "Temperature to fan output curve"
msgstr "温度与风扇输出曲线"

msgid "Temperature °C"
msgstr "温度 °C"

msgid "Temperatures"
msgstr "温度"

msgid ""
"Temperatures must rise strictly and percentages stay within 0-100%. An invalid curve makes the controller run its failsafe output instead of stopping the fan."
msgstr "温度必须严格递增，百分比须保持在 0-100%。曲线无效时控制器会转入失效保护输出，而不是让风扇停转。"

msgid "The configuration could not be reloaded: %s"
msgstr "无法重新载入配置：%s"

msgid "The configuration was accepted as-is."
msgstr "配置已按原样接受。"

msgid "The curve accepts at most 32 points."
msgstr "曲线最多支持 32 个节点。"

msgid "The curve needs at least two points."
msgstr "曲线至少需要两个节点。"

msgid ""
"The custom curve is not usable, so the controller would run its failsafe output continuously. Continue?"
msgstr "自定义曲线不可用，控制器会持续运行在失效保护输出。确定继续？"

msgid "The default custom curve was loaded into the editor. Save to store it."
msgstr "已在编辑器中载入默认自定义曲线，保存后才会写入。"

msgid ""
"The enhanced controller will be disabled and the fan will follow the kernel thermal policy only. Continue?"
msgstr "增强控制器将被禁用，风扇只跟随内核散热策略。确定继续？"

msgid ""
"The hottest option considers CPU, Ethernet PHY, both radios and the 5G modem cache."
msgstr "最高温模式会考虑 CPU、以太网 PHY、两路射频以及 5G 模组缓存。"

msgid ""
"The kernel safety floor can still raise the effective output above this value."
msgstr "内核安全下限仍可能把实际输出抬高到此值之上。"

msgid ""
"The line is sampled once per degree with the same integer arithmetic the controller uses."
msgstr "曲线按每 1 °C 采样，使用与控制器完全一致的整数运算。"

msgid "The service could not be restarted: %s"
msgstr "服务重启失败：%s"

msgid "The status command exited with code %s"
msgstr "状态命令以退出码 %s 结束"

msgid "The status reply does not match the expected contract"
msgstr "状态返回与约定的数据契约不符"

msgid "Thermal governor"
msgstr "散热 governor"

msgid "This board exposes no tachometer reading"
msgstr "该机型未提供转速读数"

msgid "Time"
msgstr "时间"

msgid "Unavailable"
msgstr "不可用"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Unsaved changes were discarded."
msgstr "已放弃未保存的更改。"

msgid "Updated"
msgstr "更新时间"

msgid ""
"Used when no sensor or no usable curve is available; the range keeps it above 75%."
msgstr "无传感器或无可用曲线时使用；取值范围保证其高于 75%。"

msgid "Value"
msgstr "数值"

msgid "What the controller is using right now, after validation and clamping."
msgstr "控制器当前实际使用的值，已完成校验与限幅。"

msgid ""
"When disabled the fan follows the kernel thermal policy only; CPU throttling and over-temperature protection are unaffected."
msgstr "禁用时风扇只跟随内核散热策略；CPU 降频与过热保护不受影响。"

msgid "Wi-Fi radio 1"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 射频 1"

msgid "Wi-Fi radio 2"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 射频 2"

msgid "Write each point as temperature:percent, for example 40:50."
msgstr "每个点写成「温度:百分比」，例如 40:50。"

msgid "Writing the fan output failed"
msgstr "写入风扇输出失败"

